---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
---

<Site title="About · Daniyaal Beg">
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
		<img
			src="/me.jpg"
			alt="Daniyaal Beg"
			width="96"
			height="96"
			class="size-24 rounded-full border border-line object-cover"
		/>
		<h1 class="font-serif text-[36px] leading-[44px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Hi, I'm Daniyaal.</h1>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-lg leading-[30px] text-pretty text-body">
			<p>
				I'm a product-minded developer in London building focused digital experiences for the web.
			</p>
			<p>
				Most of my work sits between interface design and engineering: prototyping interactions,
				shaping systems, and refining the details that make software feel good.
			</p>
			<p>
				Elsewhere, I experiment with small tools and write about animation, interfaces, and the web.
				You can find what I'm working on <a href="/#projects" class="text-ink underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-ink">on the homepage</a>,
				or say hi on <a href="https://x.com/daniyaalbeg" class="text-ink underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-ink">X</a>
				or by <a href="mailto:danyaalbeg@gmail.com" class="text-ink underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-[3px] hover:decoration-ink">email</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Site>
